              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.9.14+MRK.9.15+MRK.9.16+MRK.9.17+MRK.9.18+MRK.9.19+MRK.9.20+MRK.9.21+MRK.9.22+MRK.9.23+MRK.9.24+MRK.9.25+MRK.9.26+MRK.9.27+MRK.9.28+MRK.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 9:14-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.37+LUK.9.38+LUK.9.39+LUK.9.40+LUK.9.41+LUK.9.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 9:37-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo basike buyo kumakamu, kwakamusikila muntu umwi, wakamufugamina, waamba wati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwami, mufwide luzyalo mwanaangu, nkaambo ngusikasuntu, ulaciswa loko. Kanjikanji ulawida mumulilo na mumaanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalimuletede kulibasikwiiya bako, pele teebakakonzya kumuponya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dt 32:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.14.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joh 14:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jesu wakavuwa, waamba wati, Ikaka! inywe nubasunu batasyomi, basicinguni! Ino mazuba ongae ngenti kale kulindinywe? Mazuba ongae ngenti kazike moyo wangu kulindinywe? Amumulete okuno kulindime! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Jesu wakamunyemena. Mpawo daimona wakazwa, nkabela mwana wakapona kuzwa kuciindi eco nciconya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino basikwiiya bakaboola kuliJesu kumbali, baamba bati, Ino nkaambonzi teetwakakonzya kumutanda iswe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
