        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nibakali kuya bweendeenda mu-Galilaya, Jesu wakabaambila wati, Mwana a-Muntu ulaabwa mumaanza aabantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.22",
