            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati, Ulatela, Nkabela naakanjila muŋanda, Jesu wakasaanguna kumwambila kuti, Uyeeyanzi, Simoni? Bami baansi nkulini nkubatambula mutelo na bulumbu? Sankubana babo nanka kubeenzu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro wamwaambila wati, Nkubeenzu. Nkabela Jesu wamwaambila wati, Lino bana balaangulukide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nekubaboobo, kuti tutababilizyi, koya kulwizi, ukawaale kalobyo, ukabweze inswi iisaanguna kuzwa, elyo niwaasamuna mulomo wayo, Ulajana mali. Tola ayo, ubapede ndiswe tobile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.17.27"
            ]
